000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID. TEDICRTE.
000600
000700**************************************************************
000800*D                                                           *
000900*D  T E D I C R T E   THIS PROGRAM LAUNCHES THE JOB THAT     *
001000*D    PROCESSES THE LOGGED EDI PURCHASE ORDERS (DEDILOG).    *
001100*D    THIS PROGRAM GIVES THE USER 4 OPTIONS BY WHICH TO      *
001200*D    PROCESS THE BATCH FILE.  BASED ON THE SELECTION IT     *
001300*D    BUILDS A JOB STREAM OR ALLOWS THE USER TO SIMPLY       *
001400*D    BROWSE THE ENTRIES IN THE FILE.                        *
001700*D                                                           *
001800**************************************************************
001900*D                                                           *
002000*D  TO BUILD THE TEMPORARY JOB STREAM "BEDICRTE" THIS        *
002100*D  PROGRAM USES 2 PERMANENT PARTIAL JOB STREAMS.            *
002200*D    1) BXEDITOP    - USED TO FORM THE TOP OF THE JOB       *
002300*D       'BEDICRTE'     PRIOR TO THE USER CHOSEN SELECTIONS  *
002400*D    2) BXEDIBOT    - USED TO FORM THE BOTTOM OF THE JOB    *
002500*D       STREAM AFTER THE USER CHOSEN SELECTIONS HAVE BEEN   *
002600*D       WRITE TO THE JOB STREAM 'BEDICRTE'.                 *
002700*D                                                           *
002800**************************************************************
      *C
      *C  09/12/96  JEFF BUNGO
      *C       EXPAND DATE FIELDS FOR YEAR 2000 COMPLIANCE.
      *C       RECOMPILE TO PICK UP COPYLIB CHANGES.
005000
005100 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
005200 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
005300 SOURCE-COMPUTER.  AS400.
005400 OBJECT-COMPUTER.  AS400.

       SPECIAL-NAMES. I-O-FEEDBACK IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.
005500
005600 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
005700 FILE-CONTROL.
005800     SELECT BATCH-FILE-SORTED ASSIGN TO DISK-BATCHEDI
               ORGANIZATION IS RELATIVE
005900         ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
006000         RELATIVE KEY IS ACT-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DEDILOG-LK-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS4802
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                 WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.


           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
                  ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZEDICRTE-SI
                  ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
                  ACCESS IS SEQUENTIAL
                  FILE STATUS IS DISPLAY-STATUS
                  CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.

           SELECT MPLTINFO-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0501
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
006500
006200     SELECT EDI-CREATE-BEGIN-FILE ASSIGN TO DISK-BXEDITOP.
006300     SELECT EDI-CREATE-END-FILE ASSIGN TO DISK-BXEDIBOT.
006400     SELECT EDI-CREATE-JOB-FILE ASSIGN TO DISK-BEDICRTE.
006100     SELECT SORT-FILE ASSIGN TO DISK-SORT.
006500
006600 DATA DIVISION.
006700 FILE SECTION.
006800 FD  BATCH-FILE-SORTED
006900     RECORD CONTAINS 80 CHARACTERS
007000     LABEL RECORD IS OMITTED
007100     DATA RECORD IS BATCH-FILE-SORTED-RCD.
007200 01  BATCH-FILE-SORTED-RCD.
           05  BTEDI-KEY               PIC X(14).
           05  BTEDI-INIT-DATE         PIC X(6).
           05  BTEDI-FLAGS.
               10  BTEDI-ADD-FLAG      PIC X.
               10  BTEDI-MOD-FLAG      PIC X.
               10  BTEDI-DEL-FLAG      PIC X.
               10  BTEDI-SND-FLAG      PIC X.
               10  FILLER              PIC XX.
           05  BTEDI-VENDOR            PIC X(10).
           05  BTEDI-ITEM-NO           PIC X(4).
           05  FILLER                  PIC X(40).
009000
       FD  DEDILOG-LK-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DEDILOG-LK-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS4800 OF MCFLCS4802.

       FD  DISPLAY-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
       01  DISPLAY-REC.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF ZEDICRTE.

       FD  MPLTINFO-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MPLTINFO-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS  OF MCFLCS0501.

